                        <p>We examine the fundamentals to identify opportunities with enduring potential.</p>
                    </article>
                    <article>
                        <span>02</span>
                        <h3>Disciplined construction</h3>
                        <p>Ideas earn their place through a clear, repeatable portfolio process.</p>
